WEBVTT

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.840
Hi, Bluebold here!

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:06.500
These questions give you a pile of true choices.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.600
But only one of them does the job.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:11.160
The writer has a goal.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.280
The right answer has to serve that exact goal,

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:16.640
using facts that are actually supported.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.980
Goal: emphasize that a library is accessible.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:22.720
Now, here are the notes:

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.700
three true facts.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.140
It has brick walls.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:26.740
It is open in the evening.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:28.660
It has a step-free entrance.

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:31.120
Brick walls? True.

00:00:31.620 --> 00:00:33.780
But do they make the library easier to visit?

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:38.060
No. Gone. Evening hours and a step-free entrance?

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.600
Those do the job.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.580
Your turn. Goal:

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.860
show that a park is good for families.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.560
Choice A: it was built in nineteen fifty.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:50.800
Choice B: it has a playground and picnic tables.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.380
Which one? Go.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:00.140
B! The date is true,

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:01.580
but it doesn't do the job.

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:04.300
So read the goal first,

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.440
before the choices.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.860
Then eliminate anything that's accurate,

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:09.080
but off target.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:12.120
But relevant isn't enough either.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:13.660
Back at the library,

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.660
one choice says everyone can attend.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:17.440
Sounds perfect for accessibility,

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:20.300
right? But nothing in the notes says that.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.500
You can't add a claim without evidence.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.220
True is necessary.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.140
But the answer must also do the requested job.

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:30.040
Now hit Try this skill,

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.460
and go hit the target!
